{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Dash: Toast of Destiny is a side-scrolling, fast-paced anime action game with a classic dot-picture style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The meeting of destiny is at the end of the run!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is the most\u00a0thrilling anime action starts with being late!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character, Haruka Ran, is a regular high school girl who's eager to meet her destiny. <br>Every morning, she's always in a rush with a loaf of bread in her mouth. <br>Today's the day of the long-awaited school trip. <br>She wonders, &quot;Could it be that I meet the man of my dreams on the trip? <br>Just as I was starting to feel hopeful, I remembered: &quot;Oh no, I'm late, I'm late! Late, late, late!\u201d <br>With a slice of bread in her mouth, Ran will start running again today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_2.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't just an action game. The story unfolds through in-game animations depicting Ran\u2019s daily life. What's in store for Ran at the end of her run? Is this her destiny, or... The truth is that you'll find out the truth of your run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture2.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_1.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are simple\u2014just jump and dash\u2014but timing is everything. The speed and tempo are addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture1.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_3.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use helpful items to keep your stamina up during the run! Try to avoid things like barricades, clouds, and dogs by jumping and performing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture3.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_4.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a regular school route to a school trip to Kyoto to a date spot with a gorgeous night view! Each area is packed with gimmicks and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture5.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The screen is still in development and may differ from the final specifications.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756520?t=1749178741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/c63736613d39e227316a5d4a33b132702e16d650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749178741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/eb645ece956c902c4063c4d1ce4319ba7bee1645/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749178741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/eb645ece956c902c4063c4d1ce4319ba7bee1645/capsule_184