/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are simple\u2014just jump and dash\u2014but timing is everything. The speed and tempo are addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture1.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_3.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use helpful items to keep your stamina up during the run! Try to avoid things like barricades, clouds, and dogs by jumping and performing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture3.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/\u5dee\u3057\u8fbc\u307f_en_4.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a regular school route to a school trip to Kyoto to a date spot with a gorgeous night view! Each area is packed with gimmicks and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/capture5.png?t=1749178741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The screen is still in development and may differ from the final specifications.</p>","developers":["Clover Lab.,inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/2cfbd96019ff1fc33a04c95b010c6517760e0f8d/header.jpg?t=1749178741","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Xenotoon / clover Lab.,inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements